# PLATOON_HARD SCOUT (owner-decided 2026-08-18): harder-OpFor follow-up to
# the platoon-depth B3 read — every outcome axis saturated at n_enemies=8, so
# the depth cycle could not separate the hierarchy from its ablations on
# outcomes. Scout-then-confirm protocol: ONE seed per arm; confirmation seeds
# only for arms the scout says are worth them.
#
# Target axes: robustness (does the 14-defender garrison de-saturate the
# outcome axes?) and cohesion (no_close_teammate_rate /
# unseen_by_any_teammate_rate — measured by 450c8df, never enforced).
#
# All three scenarios are new on this tree (3c72cd1), so the pre-flight runs
# normally — no FORCE. The deliberate neutrality re-derivation rides in its
# own 1-job FORCE lane: scripts/campaigns/platoon_hard_scout_neutrality.jobs.
platoon_hard_v1_seed12          --scenario platoon_hard          --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
platoon_hard_nomask_v1_seed12   --scenario platoon_hard_nomask   --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
platoon_hard_flat_v1_seed12     --scenario platoon_hard_flat     --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12
